			<div class="content" id="post-content-1226429">
									

<p>As I said in chat:</p>
<p>I don't get what legend this is referring to, but I like this. It has a lot of neat little details. Though&#8230; the fact that I see all these neat little details makes me wonder if you could push this more. Add even more interesting stuff. It does feel slightly bare-bones. Not that I think it needs to get real bloated, or even much longer.</p>
<p>I love the example of the ghostly hound. I love that all the entities do is try to rejoin their species. I like the oddness of the original corpse vanishing. I like that they aren't malevolent&#8230; so far as we know. Just lonely and transient.</p>
<p>And, upvoted.</p>

